WEBVTT

00:14:27.121 --> 00:14:32.204
The point is, first comes an ending,
then this neutral time,

00:14:32.204 --> 00:14:35.329
which is supposed to be full
of confusion and stress.

00:14:36.037 --> 00:14:39.496
Bridges said that Western culture
doesn't make time or space for

00:14:39.496 --> 00:14:43.996
a tough period like this. We want to rush
and begin anew already, but we shouldn't.

00:14:44.621 --> 00:14:48.079
And Greg Chappell and Greg is trying
to spread this message right now

00:14:48.496 --> 00:14:50.954
because it is so applicable
in all our lives.

00:14:51.496 --> 00:14:53.454
Psychologically speaking, it's

00:14:53.454 --> 00:14:57.121
the sense that we allow ourselves
this time to not know.

00:14:57.912 --> 00:15:02.121
And that's what I want to say as a quote
unquote, observer of humanity.